4. Execution and Reproducibility
Full Automated Reproduction from Scratch
To clean previous results, run the unit test suite, execute all 23 experiments (A through W), and regenerate all CSVs, plots, and summary reports:

Bash
python scripts/rebuild_all.py
Direct Statistical Audit Invocation
To audit a specific Kyber transformation directly using the auditor interface:

Python
from auditor import analyze_scheme

# Audit compression d=10 in Kyber512
analyze_scheme(scheme="Kyber512", transformation="compression", parameters={"d": 10})
